From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jie Zhang <jie.zhang@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 20:23:13 +0000
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750-qrd: Enable Adreno 830 GPU

Enable GPU for sm8750-qrd platform and provide path for zap
shader.

Signed-off-by: Jie Zhang <jie.zhang@oss.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Akhil P Oommen <akhilpo@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Dmitry Baryshkov <dmitry.baryshkov@oss.qualcomm.com>
Reviewed-by: Konrad Dybcio <konrad.dybcio@oss.qualcomm.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20260809-pakala-gpu-v1-6-207ad1fac1c7@oss.qualcomm.com
Signed-off-by: Bjorn Andersson <andersson@kernel.org>

Link: https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/c9cf34cb19f87cd0637a9f1aecd46640c19d76ca
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-qrd.dts | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-qrd.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-qrd.dts
index b56317cfa9fc7fa8d8f055da7d4de7a6d22fd95e..75927e1f7b9ab0316781c64dbcc82d3394c414f6 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-qrd.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-qrd.dts
@@ -858,6 +858,14 @@
 	};
 };
 
+&gpu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&gpu_zap_shader {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sm8750/gen80000_zap.mbn";
+};
+
 &iris {
 	status = "okay";
 };
